<title>UK: Eurodis H1 pretax profit drops 34 pct.</title>
<headline>Eurodis H1 pretax profit drops 34 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996.</p>
<p>				 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.66		   vs 6.20</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.95		   vs 1.85</p>
<p> Pretax		     3.06		   vs 4.64</p>
<p> Turnover		   152		    vs 129</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Eurodis Electron Plc, a British distributor of electronic components. The company said it was confident the outlook for the group's performance was on a &quot;gradual upward trend&quot;.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
